  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Text reply intake and owner alert\nTwilio calls this webhook when a customer replies to your number. It reads the numbered answers (name, address, job, urgent), classifies the job type and urgency with plain keyword rules, logs the reply in your Replies sheet and emails you. STOP replies are logged as opted out and never texted again.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Copy the Production URL of the Webhook node into the sending app (POST JSON).\n2. Open the Config node and fill in your values; connect the credentials shown on each node.\n3. Activate the workflow.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
